# YOmouse

## Setup

### Step 1: Install Dependencies
```bash
pip install --upgrade opencv-python mediapipe pyautogui pynput
```

### Step 2: Connect Hardware
1. Connect your **Webcam**.
2. Connect your **Bluetooth module**.

### Step 3: Run Script
```bash
python unified_hand_mouse.py
```

---

## Controls

| Action | Control |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Move Cursor** | Move hand in front of camera (Index finger) |
| **Left Click** | Press **Play / Pause** on module |
| **Right Click** | Press **Next Track** on module |
| **Double Click** | Press **Previous Track** on module |
| **Exit** | Press **`q`** in camera window |
